ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI推出Businesses in ChatGPT企业信息主页，正式切入本地商业搜索市场</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Adobe MAX 2026发布Photoshop重打光与生成式重塑功能并预览MCP集成</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD携手Spectro Cloud发布Instinct Coder 355本地AI编程平台</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴发布全新一代千问 Qwen4 大模型，预览版已正式上线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2273a4d3e28a4a57dc6137391b1865f9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式发布全新一代千问大模型 Qwen4，该模型在知识理解、世界感知、Coding 及 Agentic 等核心能力上实现全面进阶。目前，Qwen4-Max 预览版已上线阿里 Token Plan，并开启限时 1 折体验活动。个人版 Lite 及 Essential 套餐定价为 39 元/月，新用户可享 5 折优惠至 19.5 元。为加速生态落地，千问办公、Qoder、千问 App 及 QwenStudio 等多款官方核心产品已同步完成对 Qwen4 的接入。此次迭代标志着阿里在底层模型架构上的重要升级，通过更强的智能体能力与编程表现，旨在为开发者与普通用户提供更深度的 AI 交互体验，进一步强化其在模型应用层面的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度发布文心5.5Flash Preview模型，支持百万Token上下文并于11月25日开源</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fbcab57bd8056d7f632395a8c5f34a19.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度正式发布基础模型文心5.5Flash Preview，该模型总参数量达2800亿，激活参数为140亿，支持最长100万Token上下文。在编程、3D建模及视频创作领域表现显著，通过专项训练适配Blender、CAD等工具，并支持超过15万个创作环境。目前，该模型已上线百度智能云千帆平台，提供API调用服务，定价策略极具竞争力，现阶段限时五折优惠。官方确认，文心5.5Flash Preview的模型权重将于11月25日正式面向全球开源社区发布。此次更新重点提升了模型在长周期开发任务中的规划与执行能力，以及对复杂3D场景的程序化建模能力。通过开源与低价API策略，百度旨在进一步降低开发者门槛，推动大模型在垂直场景的深度应用与落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI推出Businesses in ChatGPT企业信息主页，正式切入本地商业搜索市场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式推出Businesses in ChatGPT测试版服务，通过Business Hub企业管理中心，允许全球企业认领并管理商业资料，直接挑战Google Business Profiles体系。企业可更新地址、营业时间及服务内容，并支持上传商品价格与库存数据。为降低接入成本，OpenAI与Shopify深度整合，实现商品目录自动同步。此外，OpenAI推出Businesses Agents企业智能代理，支持企业基于自身数据创建专属AI助手，处理客户咨询。商家可通过后台查看品牌曝光及用户互动数据。目前，Businesses in ChatGPT已在ChatGPT可用地区开放测试，而Businesses Agents暂仅面向美国电商及在线服务企业开放。此举标志着ChatGPT依托12亿周活流量，正式</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Adobe MAX 2026发布Photoshop重打光与生成式重塑功能并预览MCP集成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ef82f2bf85cc8df11b093be18594186c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在Adobe MAX 2026大会上，Adobe发布了Creative Cloud全家桶的重大AI更新。Photoshop新增“重新调光”（Relight）功能，支持用户自定义光源位置、颜色与亮度，且不破坏原图；“生成式重塑”支持通过文本生成多版风格并进行滑块微调；升级后的“移除”工具可自动清理物体阴影、倒影及背景重建。Lightroom新增Glow光效及“睁眼”功能。战略层面，Adobe预览了MCP（Model Context Protocol）集成，计划于2027年初开放，届时第三方AI Agent将能直接操控Photoshop、Illustrator、Premiere与After Effects的本地工程文件，保留图层、矢量及序列等可编辑属性。此外，Premiere Pro引入“生成媒体”功能，支持在时间</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD携手Spectro Cloud发布Instinct Coder 355本地AI编程平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/77104b487d7af4786b4cc0c793d09623.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD于11月9日联合Spectro Cloud推出企业级AI辅助编程平台Instinct Coder 355，旨在实现大模型本地化推理。该系统核心配置包括8张AMD Instinct MI355X加速器、2颗64核EPYC 9575F处理器、3TB DDR5-6400内存及63.36TB固态存储。硬件由戴尔与Supermicro提供整机支持，单节点可支撑85名开发者，并支持50人同时在线编码。该平台搭载PaletteAI Inference Launchpad管理软件，默认调用本地算力运行GLM-5.3模型，性能据称逼近前沿模型的98%。通过将推理任务从云端迁移至本地机房，该方案有效解决了企业在敏感代码数据合规性及云端API调用成本方面的痛点，为企业级开发环境提供了高性能、高安全性的本地化算力支撑。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
